                    <h2 id="endpoints-PATCHapi-pets--pet--health-medications--record--deactivate">PATCH /pets/{pet}/health/medications/{recordId}/deactivate</h2>

<p>
</p>

<p>Marks a medication as <code>active=false</code> and pins the <code>end_date</code> to today (or a
caller-specified date). Distinct from DELETE — the prescription stays in
the history, it just stops counting as "in use".</p>

<span id="example-requests-PATCHapi-pets--pet--health-medications--record--deactivate">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request PATCH \
    "http://localhost:8000/api/pets/architecto/health/medications/architecto/deactivate" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json" \
    --data "{
    \"reason\": \"b\",
    \"end_date\": \"2026-09-06T13:23:09\"
}"
