                    <h2 id="endpoints-GETapi-messages-conversations">GET /messages/conversations[?include=first_conversation_messages]</h2>

<p>
</p>

<p>The opt-in <code>include</code> hydrates the thread of the conversation listed first,
so a client opening the screen renders messages in one round trip instead
of listing, picking the first id and fetching again.</p>

